{"id":9301649555671,"handle":"odara-scarpe-ortopediche-slip-on","title":"Winnie | Supportive slip-on for all-day ease","vendor":"MODESSAE","type":"","tags":[],"createdAt":"2026-06-16T18:16:21+10:00","publishedAt":"2026-06-16T18:16:21+10:00","bodyHtml":"<p>Say goodbye to sore feet and hello to shoes that actually work for you. These slip-ons are engineered with supportive architecture that takes pressure off your heels, knees and lower back, so you can wear them all day without thinking twice. The soft, forgiving upper stretches gently to accommodate wider feet, bunions or any swelling, while the lightweight design keeps you comfortable whether you're running errands in Melbourne or dressing up for dinner.</p><p><strong>Why you'll love it</strong></p><ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Slip-on convenience</strong> — no laces, no fussing, just effortless on and off</li>\n<li>Removes pressure from heels, knees and lower back for all-day comfort</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Removable insole</strong> fits custom orthotics for personalised support</li>\n<li>Soft, stretchy upper that moves with wider feet without digging in</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Minimalist design</strong> works equally well with casual outfits or dressier looks</li>\n<li>Lightweight so your feet don't feel weighed down by end of day</li>\n<li>Hard to find shoes this supportive that don't look medical</li>\n</ul><hr><p><em>Over 50,000 women have already chosen us, with an average rating of 4.8 out of 5. Your happiness and your trust mean everything to us.</em></p>","options":[{"name":"Color","values":["Grey","Apricot","Pink","Black","Purple","Red"]},{"name":"Size","values":["36","37","38","39","40","41","42","43"]}],"variants":[{"id":48790908010711,"title":"Grey / 36","options":["Grey","36"],"price":"59.95","compareAtPrice":"119.90","available":true,"sku":"LL810-Gris-36","featuredImageId":47233716486359},{"id":48790908043479,"title":"Apricot / 36","options":["Apricot","36"],"price":"59.95","compareAtPrice":"119.90","available":true,"